<title>BELGIUM: EU clears Promodes control of Gruppo G -source.</title>
<headline>EU clears Promodes control of Gruppo G -source.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Commission has cleared the increased stake taken by French retailer Promodes SA in Italian hyper and supermarket Gruppo G Srl, a European Union source said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The deal was submitted for clearance on November 13 under the merger regulation.</p>
<p>Promodes said in September it had raised its stake in Gruppo G to 80 percent from 34.5 percent.</p>
<p>-- Brussels newsroom +32 2 287 68 11</p>
</text>
